+/// Fork addition: the native output layout of a full-image, full-resolution
+/// request, derived from header facts alone without the batch engine's
+/// per-image planning. Covers raw codestreams with one or three unsigned
+/// components of equal precision; any other request returns `J2K_UNSUPPORTED`
